flowchart TD
    A[Task input] --> B[Agent understands goal]
    B --> C[Generate execution plan]
    C --> D[Run commands in terminal]
    D --> E{Execution feedback}
    E -->|Error or missing evidence| F[Debug and revise plan]
    F --> D
    E -->|Artifact produced| G[Run external verifier]
    G --> H{Pass or fail}
    H -->|Pass| I[Record success]
    H -->|Fail| J[Extract minimal evidence pack]
    J --> K[Assign L1 and L2 diagnosis]
    K --> L[Choose one workflow change]
    L --> D
